mported symbols all resolve: _normalize_comment_body is defined at rebar_reconciler/outbound_comments.py:119 and re-exported by outbound_differ.py:38. The reported ModuleNotFoundError only reproduces on a worktree/editable-install predating commit 3d8be7fec (2026-06-29), which CREATED outbound_comments.py in the per-concern differ split — such a stale tree has the rebar_reconciler package (so 'import rebar_reconciler' works) but lacks the outbound_comments submodule (so the dotted import fails). Resolution: already fixed on main by that split; no behavior change needed. Added a regression guard (tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_outbound_comments_split_import.py) that imports outbound_differ and asserts the re-exported comment-split names resolve — verified teeth: renaming outbound_comments.py away reproduces the exact ModuleNotFoundError (RED), present = GREEN. This pins the split so a real future removal/rename fails loudly here instead of resurfacing as a confusing collection error.","timestamp":1783057284669600001}],"created_at":1783056835135897001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"ae7b3222-da84-4d8c-bb50-207de3a36fe5","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"908b-5d96-01eb-4208"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nImporting `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/outbound_differ.py` fails at line ~38 with `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'rebar_reconciler.outbound_comments'`, surfacing as a pytest COLLECTION ERROR on `tests/scripts/reducer/test_managed_refs.py` during a full-suite run. Discovered while landing the open-bugs batch (reducer-cache / linter / perf / reconcile-test fixes).\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\n1. Fresh venv on current main: `python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -e '.[dev]'`.\n2. `.venv/bin/pytest tests/scripts/reducer/test_managed_refs.py -q` (or a full-suite run).\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n\n- **Expected:** the module imports and the test collects/runs (or skips) cleanly.\n- **Actual:** `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'rebar_reconciler.outbound_comments'` raised from `outbound_differ.py`, erroring the whole test module at collection.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `import rebar_reconciler.outbound_differ` succeeds (no ModuleNotFoundError) on a fresh install from main.\n- [x] The symbols the importer needs (e.g. `_normalize_comment_body`) resolve to their real definition location; the import points at the correct module.\n- [x] `tests/scripts/reducer/test_managed_refs.py` collects and runs (passes/skips) rather than erroring at import.\n- [x] A regression test guards the import/collection so the breakage cannot silently recur.\n- [x] No regression in `tests/scripts/reducer/`.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"8f8df9de-24b5-4c69-b8db-2764b6abc1fc","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","status_fork_resolutions":[{"dropped_uuid":"df75413b-790b-4fb1-b590-3f3e0990b4b4","winner_uuid":"8f8df9de-24b5-4c69-b8db-2764b6abc1fc"}],"tags":[],"ticket_id":"3e3f-8236-d619-43d7","ticket_type":"bug","title":"outbound_differ imports a missing rebar_reconciler.outbound_comments module (collection error in test_managed_refs)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["977f11b7-9bdb-475d-9bf9-97e7857e6d7d","d01b077f-9506-4d14-8b94-55c83dac9ff6","1282aaae-78fd-4ecf-9201-51fcdbbba149","ae7b3222-da84-4d8c-bb50-207de3a36fe5","a3e9b103-6d46-4ae7-97c9-130a74161e0c","df75413b-790b-4fb1-b590-3f3e0990b4b4","205f16be-2558-47c2-97c5-572441b33db4","a7db3580-fc4d-46c6-bec5-cddf45bb23dc","e224bf50-c406-4349-8478-24c8240edd87","8f8df9de-24b5-4c69-b8db-2764b6abc1fc","da655847-1d2f-439d-9d1f-645d2e961777"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":178629